ble Language Translation'=>'Enable Language Translation','When enabled, Google Sheet tab names will be displayed in the language selected for your WordPress site.'=>'When enabled, Google Sheet tab names will be displayed in the language selected for your WordPress site.','Headers'=>'Headers','Custom order statuses will appear here. Turn them on to create a new tab for each in your Google Sheet.'=>'Custom order statuses will appear here. Turn them on to create a new tab for each in your Google Sheet.','No custom order statuses are currently available.'=>'No custom order statuses are currently available.','Enable additional Sheet tabs to sync more WooCommerce information to your Google Sheet. Each selected option will create and update its own tab automatically.'=>'Enable additional Sheet tabs to sync more WooCommerce information to your Google Sheet. Each selected option will create and update its own tab automatically.','All Products'=>'All Products','All Products Variation'=>'All Products Variation','All Customers'=>'All Customers','All Coupons'=>'All Coupons','All Subscriptions'=>'All Subscriptions','Choose how orders should appear in your Google Sheet:'=>'Choose how orders should appear in your Google Sheet:','Order Wise :'=>'Order Wise :','Each order is added as a single row, even if it contains multiple products.'=>'Each order is added as a single row, even if it contains multiple products.','Product Wise :'=>'Product Wise :','Each product in an order is added as a separate row, so you can see details for every item.'=>'Each product in an order is added as a separate row, so you can see details for every item.','You can also choose how the entries are sorted (ascending or descending). Your selected format and sorting will be applied across all tabs in the sheet.'=>'You can also choose how the entries are sorted (ascending or descending). Your selected format and sorting will be applied across all tabs in the sheet.','Select Sync Format'=>'Select Sync Format','Order Wise'=>'Order Wise','Product Wise'=>'Product Wise','Sorting'=>'Sorting','Ascending'=>'Ascending','Descending'=>'Descending','Order Category Filter'=>'Order Category Filter','Filter orders by category before syncing to your Google Sheet. When enabled, only selected categories will be synced. When disabled, all orders will be included. This applies to adding, updating, and syncing orders.'=>'Filter orders by category before syncing to your Google Sheet. When enabled, only selected categories will be synced. When disabled, all orders will be included. This applies to adding, updating, and syncing orders.','Select Category'=>'Select Category','Product Category Filter'=>'Product Category Filter','Filter products by category before syncing to your Google Sheet. When enabled, only selected categories will be synced. When disabled, all products will be included. This applies to adding, updating, and syncing products.'=>'Filter products by category before syncing to your Google Sheet. When enabled, only selected categories will be synced. When disabled, all products will be included. This applies to adding, updating, and syncing products.','Sync data between WooCommerce and Google Sheets in real-time. Enable this feature to manage orders, products, and more directly from your spreadsheet.'=>'Sync data between WooCommerce and Google Sheets in real-time. Enable this feature to manage orders, products, and more directly from your spreadsheet.','Enable 2-Way Sync'=>'Enable 2-Way Sync','Allow Google Sheets to update WooCommerce data.'=>'Allow Google Sheets to update WooCommerce data.','Select Sync Modules'=>'Select Sync Modules','Allowed Actions'=>'Allowed Actions','Insert'=>'Insert','Update'=>'Update','Delete'=>'Delete','Select fields to add as new columns in your sheet. Enter a column name for each field. These columns will be included when your data syncs.'=>'Select fields to add as new columns in your sheet. Enter a column name for each field. These columns will be included when your data syncs.','Product Variation'=>'Product Variation','Additional Order Columns'=>'Additional Order Columns','Enter Column Name'=>'Enter Column Name','Add'=>'Add',' Upgrade To Pro'=>' Upgrade To Pro','Additional Product Columns'=>'Additional Product Columns','Additional Custom Columns'=>'Additional Custom Columns','Additional Empty Columns'=>'Additional Empty Columns','Enable All Columns'=>'Enable All Columns','Additional Product Variation Columns'=>'Additional Product Variation Columns','Cron Settings'=>'Cron Settings','Enable Cron Sync'=>'Enable Cron Sync','Turn on automatic scheduling'=>'Turn on automatic scheduling','Set Schedule'=>'Set Schedule','No Schedule'=>'No Schedule','Choose Schedule Type'=>'Choose Schedule Type','Repeat Weekly'=>'Repeat Weekly','Run Once'=>'Run Once','How Often'=>'How Often','Select Day'=>'Select Day','Time'=>'Time','Real-Time Sync'=>'Real Time Sync','Sync instantly when new orders are created'=>'Sync instantly when new orders are created','Header Settings'=>'Header Settings','Customize the appearance and behavior of your sheet headers and rows for better readability and organization.'=>'Customize the appearance and behavior of your sheet headers and rows for better readability and organization.','Header Behavior'=>'Header Behavior','Freeze Header'=>'Freeze Header','Header Style'=>'Header Style','Header Appearance'=>'Header Appearance','Font Style'=>'Font Style','Normal'=>'Normal','Italic'=>'Italic','Bold'=>'Bold','Font Size'=>'Font Size','Select size'=>'Select size','11'=>'11','12'=>'12','13'=>'13','14'=>'14','Font Color'=>'Font Color','Header Background'=>'Header Background','Row Style'=>'Row Style','Row Appearance'=>'Row Appearance','Odd Row Color'=>'Odd Row Color','Even Row Color'=>'Even Row Color','Spreadsheet Download'=>'Spreadsheet Download','Download'=>'Download','Google Sheets Data Sync'=>'Google Sheets Data Sync','Effortlessly sync your WooCommerce data with Google Sheets. Available options include Orders, Products, Product Variations, Customers, Coupons, and Subscriptions. Select only the sync types that best suit your needs. This ensures seamless integration and real-time updates for efficient data management.'=>'Effortlessly sync your WooCommerce data with Google Sheets. Available options include Orders, Products, Product Variations, Customers, Coupons, and Subscriptions. Select only the sync types that best suit your needs. This ensures seamless integration and real-time updates for efficient data management.','Sync Orders'=>'Sync Orders','Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce orders seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest order information, based on your configuration done above, providing you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized orders.'=>'Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce orders seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest order information, based on your configuration done above, providing you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized orders.','From Date'=>'From Date','To Date'=>'To Date','Order Status'=>'Order Status','Sync Products'=>'Sync Products','Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce products seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest product information, based on your configuration done above, providing you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Before starting the sync, ensure that the products tab toggle is enabled to optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized product data.'=>'Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce products seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest product information, based on your configuration done above, providing you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Before starting the sync, ensure that the products tab toggle is enabled to optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized product data.','Sync Products Variation'=>'Sync Products Variation','Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce products variations seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest product information, based on your configuration done above. If you are using variable products, then only data will be shown in the sheet. Before starting the sync, ensure that the products variation tab toggle is enabled to optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized product data.'=>'Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce products variations seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest product information, based on your configuration done above. If you are using variable products, then only data will be shown in the sheet. Before starting the sync, ensure that the products variation tab toggle is enabled to optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized product data.','Sync Customers'=>'Sync Customers','Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce Customers seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest order information, based on your configuration done above, providing you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized orders.'=>'Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce Customers seamlessly with a single click. This ensures that your Google Sheet stays up-to-date with the latest order information, based on your configuration done above, providing you with real-time insights and streamlined data management. Optimize your workflow with the convenience of synchronized orders.','Sync Coupons'=>'Sync Coupons','Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce coupons seamlessly with a single click. This process ensures that your Google Sheet reflects the latest coupon information, following the configuration set above. Benefit from real-time insights and streamlined data management. Before starting the sync, confirm that the coupons tab toggle is enabled enhancing your workflow with the convenience of synchronized coupon data.'=>'Initiate the synchronization of your WooCommerce coupons seamlessly with a single click. This process ensures that your Google Sheet reflects the latest coupon information, following the configuration set above. Benefit from real-time insights and streamlined data management. Before starting the sync, confirm that the coupons tab toggle is enabled enhancing your workflow with the convenience of synchronized coupon data.','Sync Subscriptions'=>'Sync Subscriptions','View Documentation'=>'View Documentation','Get Support'=>'Get Support','GSheetConnector WooCommerce Add-on requires WooCommerce plugin to be installed and activated.'=>'GSheetConnector WooCommerce Add-on requires WooCommerce plugin to be installed and activated.','https://wordpress.org/plugins/wc-gsheetconnector/'=>'https://wordpress.org/plugins/wc-gsheetconnector/','Send your WooCommerce data to your Google Sheets spreadsheet.'=>'Send your WooCommerce data to your Google Sheets spreadsheet.','GSheetConnector'=>'GSheetConnector','https://www.gsheetconnector.com/'=>'https://www.gsheetconnector.com/']];
